CM_ SG_ 2566573919 CtrlPilotSubState "Indicates the EVSE sub-state as determined by the frequency of the Control Pilot as defined by IEC-61851 and J1772.";
CM_ SG_ 2566573919 CtrlPilotState "Indicates the EVSE state as determined by the peak voltage level of the Control Pilot and representing states A to F as defined by IEC-61851 and J1772.";
CM_ SG_ 2566573919 CtrlPilotDutyCycle "The control pilot from the off-board EVSE is either a DC signal or a square wave. This parameter contains the duty cycle of the PWM square wave.";
