00b = Disable DC/AC Accessory Inverter Output
01b = Enable DC/AC Accessory ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565942823 EPTO_Status2 "Signal to the DC/AC Accessory Inverter indicating the state of the device attached to the inverter output.  Each output may control multiple devices (e.g. electric motors) if they all operate at the same frequency.
