CM_ SG_ 2565942823 EPTO_FrequencyCommand "Command to the DC/AC Accessory Inverter indicating the Inverter frequency desired for the device(s) attached to the inverter output.  Each output may control multiple devices (e.g. electric motors) if they all operate at the same frequency.";
CM_ SG_ 2565942823 EPTO_FreqRateOfChangeLmt "Signal to the DC/AC Accessory Inverter indicating the frequency rate of change limit of the device(s) attached to the inverter output (Note: Increasing and decreasing rates can be controlled by the same signal).  Each output may control multiple ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565942823 EPTO_RatedRMSVoltage "Signal to the DC/AC Accessory Inverter indicating the rated RMS voltage of the device(s) attached to the inverter output.   Each output may control multiple devices (e.g. electric motors) if they all operate at the same frequency.";
CM_ SG_ 2565942823 EPTO_RatedFrequency "Signal to the DC/AC Accessory Inverter indicating the rated frequency of the device(s) attached to the inverter output.  Each output may control multiple devices (e.g. electric motors) if they all operate at the same frequency.";
